{"id":"L-meta-5420","title":"Rebuilding around removed gates: AND/OR fan-in-two edge circuit, Om removed, readers Rd below F, leaves Lv served by star wires: a circuit for F at that price","formal_statement":"∀ (n : ℕ) (G : SimpleGraph (Fin n)) [DecidableRel G.Adj] (C : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit) (Om Rd Dd Lv Z Fo : Finset ℕ) (V : ℕ → Finset (Fin n)) (O : Fin n → Finset ℕ), PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 n C → PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun n C = PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.graphFun G ∅ → (∀ k ∈ Om, k < C.gates.length ∧ C.output ≠ n + k) → (∀ X : ℕ, X ∈ Rd ↔ (X < C.gates.length ∧ X ∉ Om ∧ ∃ k ∈ Om, n + k ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C X).inputs)) → (∀ X ∈ Rd, PEqualNP.TopForm.BelowF G C X) → (∀ j ∈ Dd, j < C.gates.length ∧ j ∉ Om ∧ j ∉ Rd) → Lv ⊆ Rd → (∀ k < C.gates.length, k ∉ Om → k ∉ Rd → k ∉ Dd → ∀ j : ℕ, n + j ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C k).inputs → j ∉ Dd ∧ (j ∈ Rd → j ∈ Lv)) → (∀ j : ℕ, C.output = n + j → j ∉ Dd ∧ (j ∈ Rd → j ∈ Lv)) → (∀ X ∈ Lv, ∀ c ∈ V X, (O c).Nonempty ∧ ∀ w ∈ O c, (w < n ∨ (n ≤ w ∧ w - n < C.gates.length ∧ w - n ∉ Dd ∧ ∀ k ∈ Om, k ≠ w - n ∧ ¬ PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.InCone n C k (w - n))) ∧ ∀ x : Fin n → Bool, (C.wires (List.ofFn x)).getD w false = true → ∃ q : Fin n, G.Adj c q ∧ x q = true) → (∀ X ∈ Lv, ∀ u v : Fin n, G.Adj u v → PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.gateVal n C X (PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.pairInput u v) = true → ∃ c ∈ V X, (c = u ∨ c = v) ∧ ∃ w ∈ O c, (C.wires (List.ofFn (PEqualNP.EdgeOwnership.pairInput u v))).getD w false = true) → (∀ j ∈ Z, (j ∈ Lv ∧ V j = ∅) ∨ (j < C.gates.length ∧ j ∉ Om ∧ j ∉ Rd ∧ j ∉ Dd ∧ (((PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).op = PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.GateOp.and ∧ ∃ i ∈ Z, n + i ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).inputs) ∨ ∀ w ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).inputs, ∃ i ∈ Z, w = n + i))) → (∀ j ∈ Fo, j < C.gates.length ∧ j ∉ Om ∧ j ∉ Rd ∧ j ∉ Dd ∧ ∃ i ∈ Z, n + i ∈ (PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.gateAt C j).inputs) → ∃ D : PEqualNP.CircuitLowerBounds.Circuit, PEqualNP.TopForm.IsAO2 n D ∧ PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.circuitFun n D = PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.NestedCover.graphFun G ∅ ∧ D.size + Om.card + Rd.card + Dd.card + Fo.card + (Lv.filter (fun X => (V X).Nonempty)).card ≤ C.size + ∑ X ∈ Lv, (V X).card + ∑ c ∈ Lv.biUnion V, (O c).card","statement_hash":"sha256:38b72ec0444261ecdfb0f53143f4ed0f2cd940488a29a543d9e9b871325fb2ba","plain_statement":"F: G's edge function; C: AND/OR, 2 earlier wires/gate, =F. Om: gates ≠output. Rd = gates ∉Om reading an Om gate; all ≤F. Dd: gates ∉Om∪Rd. Lv⊆Rd. Kept: gate ∉Om∪Rd∪Dd. Wires kept gates read, and the output, are no Dd gates, and Rd gates only in Lv. c∈V X, X∈Lv: O c≠∅, inputs or gates ∉Dd∪Om with no Om gate in their cone, each ≤ OR of c's neighbours. X∈Lv on at edge uv ⇒ some c∈V X∩{u,v} has an O c wire on at uv. Z: Lv gates with V X=∅, or kept: AND reading Z, or reading only Z. Fo: kept gates reading Z. Some such D=F has |D|+|Om|+|Rd|+|Dd|+|Fo|+#{X∈Lv: V X≠∅} ≤ |C|+Σ_Lv|V X|+Σ_{c∈∪V(Lv)}|O c|.","status":"checked","barrier":null,"depends_on":[],"program":"meta_complexity","seat":"seat-clb-1","proposed_at":"2026-11-25T00:15:53.625Z","attempts":[{"when":"2026-11-25T00:17:47.009Z","ended_at":"2026-11-25T00:17:47.009Z","by":"seat-clb-1","outcome":"checked","funded_by":{"kind":"baseline","name":"Brilliant"}}],"artifact":{"lean_file":"lean/PEqualNP/MetaComplexity/L5420.lean","checker_version":"check-lean 3, Lean 4.36.0, Mathlib fc4f59e577","checker_run_id":"run-049795","content_hash":"sha256:1ffb3f52786180f14f3a3fcfc8f5ad39308a6aeaa362acdf1262fea061d36a93","rests_on":[{"module":"PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.Helpers.FoldCircuit","sha256":"sha256:4787a67da0c16d70b9ce8b7d0201d208203c9e2fa332ece23121c5519433f5b7"},{"module":"PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.Helpers.FoldProg","sha256":"sha256:48518183a3b272508edb52233d048ca0360a29a2517b012c03d71aee728446ff"},{"module":"PEqualNP.MetaComplexity.Helpers.HullMove","sha256":"sha256:37223d435777f172dd701d6e28a41